query deadlines is:
    which thing has which temporal specification as deadline.

query due_dates is:
    which agent has which action due on which date.

query due_in_2027 is:
    which agent has which action due on which date in the period from 2027-01-01 to 2027-12-31.

query must_perform is:
    which party must perform which action by which date under which rule.

query applies is:
    which rule applies to which party.

query rules_without_conditions is:
    which rule has no written conditions.

query places is:
    which rule is laid down in which place.

query addressers is:
    which agent acts as addresser in which action.

query addressees is:
    which agent acts as addressee in which action.

query beneficiaries is:
    which agent acts as beneficiary in which action.

query triggers is:
    which thing is triggered by which event.

query kinds is:
    which thing is of the kind which kind.

query rules_of_act is:
    which rule is established by the act which act.

query provisions is:
    which thing is established in which provision.

query joint_rules is:
    which rule is established in more than one provision.

query prescriptive is:
    which thing is a prescriptive rule.

query constitutive is:
    which thing is a constitutive rule.

query actions_of_rules is:
    which rule produces which action.

query actions_of_agents is:
    which agent acts as which role in which action.

query concerned_agents is:
    which rule concerns which agent.

query starting_points is:
    which thing has which temporal specification as starting point.

query validity is:
    which thing has which temporal specification as validity.

query first_dates is:
    the first date of which temporal specification is which date.

query last_dates is:
    the last date of which temporal specification is which date.

query later_times is:
    which temporal specification is later than which second temporal specification.

query times_within is:
    which temporal specification is during which second temporal specification.

query broken_links is:
    which temporal specification breaks its link with which second temporal specification.

query results is:
    which action has the result which result.

query datasets_of_results is:
    which dataset holds which result.

query digital_dimensions is:
    which rule has the digital dimension which dimension.

query processes is:
    which rule involves the process which process.

query datasets is:
    which thing is a dataset.

query standards is:
    which thing conforms to which standard.

query references is:
    which rule references which resource.

query parts is:
    which thing is part of the description.

query texts is:
    which thing is described by the text which text.

query addresses is:
    which thing is identified by which address.

query bearer is:
    the bearer role is which role.

